<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-157.1-multi-element-arrangement-identification-and-performance-obligation-assessment" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4625" name="W4625. Revenue-Stream &amp; Contract-Portfolio Register Maintenance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New channel/revenue stream; quarterly close; annual policy refresh
Frequency: Continuous register maintenance + quarterly reconcile
Volume: 1 enterprise revenue-stream register; ~20+ distinct revenue types across 5 entities
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager (Controller org)
Participants: Controller, CFO, Channel owners (VS-10/11/13/45/47/48/53/54/92/95/142/154/155/156), Tax (VS-79), External Auditor
Source: workflow W4625 — Revenue-Stream &amp; Contract-Portfolio Register Maintenance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4625_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4625_Lane1" name="Revenue Accounting Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4625_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4625_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4625_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4625_Lane2" name="Channel Owners">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4625_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4625_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4625_Start4" name="New channel/revenue stream; quarterly close; annual policy refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4625_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4625_Task5" name="Revenue Accounting maintains the enterprise revenue-stream &amp; contract-portfolio…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Accounting maintains the enterprise revenue-stream &amp; contract-portfolio register: each stream mapped to (a) owning channel/VS, (b) entity, (c) PFRS 15 treatment summary, (d) performance obligation(s), (e) recognition trigger, (f) gross/net posture, (g) deferred vs. current, (h) disclosure category
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4625_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4625_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4625_Task6" name="Each channel owner confirms its streams (POS cash-and-carry, BOPIS, delivery…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Each channel owner confirms its streams (POS cash-and-carry, BOPIS, delivery, installation, subscription, retail media, marketplace commission, consignment sell-through, gift card, loyalty, trade-in, COD, VAS/bills-payment, construction-finance referral) are captured and unchanged/changed
Responsible (R): Channel Owners / Revenue Accounting
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4625_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4625_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4625_Task7" name="Revenue Accounting reconciles the register to GL revenue accounts and to the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Accounting reconciles the register to GL revenue accounts and to the W487 legacy scenario list; flags any stream lacking a documented PFRS 15 decision or any GL account lacking an owning stream
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting Manager / Controller
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4625_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4625_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4625_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4625_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4625_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-701 (ensure controlled execution — Multi-Element Arrangement Identification &amp; Performance Obligation Assessment (PA-157.1).) | - CTL-701: every revenue stream has a documented PFRS 15 decision (links VS-21 financial-controls audit); register reconciled to GL quarterly; new streams gated by W4645
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager (Controller org)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4625_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4625_Annotation9" targetRef="W4625_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4625_Flow11" sourceRef="W4625_Start4" targetRef="W4625_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4625_Flow12" sourceRef="W4625_Task5" targetRef="W4625_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4625_Flow13" sourceRef="W4625_Task6" targetRef="W4625_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4625_Flow14" sourceRef="W4625_Task7" targetRef="W4625_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4625_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4625_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4625">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4625_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4625_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4625_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W4625_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4625_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W4625_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4625_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W4625_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4625_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W4625_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4625_Start4_di" bpmnElement="W4625_Start4"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4625_End8_di" bpmnElement="W4625_End8"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="317" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
