    <bpmn:process id="W_W4629" name="W4629. Consignment &amp; VMI Revenue-Timing &amp; Sell-Through Recognition" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Consignment/VMI setup (VS-45); monthly sell-through settlement
Frequency: Monthly settlement + per setup
Volume: ~300 VMI/consignment SKUs from 12 vendors; monthly settlements
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager
Participants: Merchandising (VS-45), Vendor Mgmt (VS-03), Controller, Tax (VS-79)
Source: workflow W4629 — Consignment &amp; VMI Revenue-Timing &amp; Sell-Through Recognition</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4629_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4629_Lane1" name="Revenue Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4629_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4629_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4629_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4629_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4629_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4629_Start3" name="Consignment/VMI setup (VS-45); monthly sell-through settlement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4629_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4629_Task4" name="Confirm revenue is NOT recognized at consignment-stock receipt (goods remain…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Confirm revenue is NOT recognized at consignment-stock receipt (goods remain vendor-owned per VS-45.1); recognize only at customer sell-through (W543 trigger) — verify the inventory ownership flag and the sell-through feed
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per settlement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4629_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4629_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4629_Task5" name="Compute consignment/VMI revenue at sell-through price, validate against the POS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Compute consignment/VMI revenue at sell-through price, validate against the POS sell-through report (W543) and the vendor settlement (VS-45.3), and confirm BuildRight is principal (gross) for consignment sales to the consumer
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4629_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4629_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4629_Task6" name="Post revenue + AP/vendor-payable at sell-through; reconcile the consignment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Post revenue + AP/vendor-payable at sell-through; reconcile the consignment inventory balance (vendor-owned) against recognized revenue and the monthly vendor statement; investigate any unmatched sell-through
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / AP
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4629_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4629_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4629_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4629_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4629_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-701 (ensure controlled execution — Multi-Element Arrangement Identification &amp; Performance Obligation Assessment (PA-157.1).) | - CTL-701: ownership-flag prevents premature recognition; three-way reconcile (POS × vendor settlement × consignment inventory) monthly; principal/gross posture documented
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
