    <bpmn:process id="W_W4630" name="W4630. Layaway, Customer-Deposit &amp; Bill-and-Hold Recognition Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Layaway/deposit transaction (VS-08/VS-11); bill-and-hold request; annual review
Frequency: Per arrangement type + quarterly deposit review
Volume: Layaway/custom-order deposits on project &amp; special orders (~thousands/yr); bill-and-hold rare
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager
Participants: Store/Trade ops (VS-07/VS-11), AR (VS-16), Controller, Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4630 — Layaway, Customer-Deposit &amp; Bill-and-Hold Recognition Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4630_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4630_Lane1" name="Revenue Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4630_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4630_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4630_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4630_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4630_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4630_Start3" name="Layaway/deposit transaction (VS-08/VS-11); bill-and-hold request; annual review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4630_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4630_Task4" name="Assess revenue recognition for customer deposits &amp; layaway: deposit = contract…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Assess revenue recognition for customer deposits &amp; layaway: deposit = contract liability (deferred) until control transfers (delivery for layaway; milestone for project deposits W546); do NOT recognize at cash receipt
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per type</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4630_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4630_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4630_Task5" name="For bill-and-hold (customer pays but asks BuildRight to hold inventory), apply…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: For bill-and-hold (customer pays but asks BuildRight to hold inventory), apply the PFRS 15 criteria (commercial reason, segregated, ready for transfer, timing fixed) before recognizing at billing rather than delivery
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Trade Ops
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4630_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4630_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4630_Task6" name="Reconcile the customer-deposit/contract-liability GL balance to the open…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile the customer-deposit/contract-liability GL balance to the open layaway/deposit/POU (point-of-use) list quarterly; release to revenue at the control-transfer trigger
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / AR
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4630_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4630_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4630_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4630_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4630_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-701 (ensure controlled execution — Multi-Element Arrangement Identification &amp; Performance Obligation Assessment (PA-157.1).) | - CTL-701: deposits posted to contract liability (not revenue); bill-and-hold criteria checklist; contract-liability GL reconciled to open-deposit list quarterly
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
