    <bpmn:process id="W_W4631" name="W4631. Loyalty-Points, Rewards &amp; Deferred-Revenue Performance Obligation Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Loyalty program change (VS-13); new reward tier/partner; annual fair-value refresh
Frequency: Per change + annual fair-value reset
Volume: 1 loyalty program; 600K members; ~ points earned on every one of 2.8M monthly POS transactions
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager
Participants: Loyalty (VS-13), Marketing (VS-14), Actuarial/Analytics, Controller, External Auditor
Source: workflow W4631 — Loyalty-Points, Rewards &amp; Deferred-Revenue Performance Obligation Setup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4631_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4631_Lane1" name="Revenue Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4631_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4631_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4631_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4631_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4631_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4631_Start3" name="Loyalty program change (VS-13); new reward tier/partner; annual fair-value refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4631_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4631_Task4" name="Confirm loyalty points are a separate performance obligation (distinct from the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Confirm loyalty points are a separate performance obligation (distinct from the underlying sale); allocate a portion of the transaction price to points at each earning transaction based on standalone selling price (W4633/W4636) — defer that portion
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Loyalty
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per setup + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4631_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4631_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4631_Task5" name="Set the breakage/forfeiture estimate and the points fair value; recognize…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Set the breakage/forfeiture estimate and the points fair value; recognize deferred revenue to revenue when points are redeemed (or expire/forfeit) per W4636; review the estimate each period
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Analytics
Accountable (A): Controller / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4631_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4631_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4631_Task6" name="Reconcile the points-deferred-revenue GL to the loyalty-engine points liability…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile the points-deferred-revenue GL to the loyalty-engine points liability (W104/W17) and the redemption feed monthly; investigate redemption-rate drift
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Loyalty ops
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4631_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4631_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4631_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4631_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4631_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-701 (ensure controlled execution — Multi-Element Arrangement Identification &amp; Performance Obligation Assessment (PA-157.1).) | - CTL-701: documented SSP/breakage methodology (External-Auditor reviewed); engine-to-GL monthly reconcile; estimate refreshed quarterly
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4631_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4631_Annotation8" targetRef="W4631_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
