    <bpmn:process id="W_W4632" name="W4632. Project &amp; Government Over-Time-vs-Point-in-Time Recognition Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project/contract milestone (VS-11/VS-46); annual policy review
Frequency: Per project type + periodic
Volume: ~ Project/B2B/G2G contracts (VS-11/VS-46); material project revenue (~30% trade + 10% corporate)
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager
Participants: Trade/Government sales (VS-11/VS-46), Project Finance, Controller, Tax (VS-79), External Auditor
Source: workflow W4632 — Project &amp; Government Over-Time-vs-Point-in-Time Recognition Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4632_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4632_Lane1" name="Revenue Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4632_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4632_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4632_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4632_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4632_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4632_Start3" name="Project/contract milestone (VS-11/VS-46); annual policy review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4632_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4632_Task4" name="For project/government contracts (VS-11.2/VS-46.2), assess over-time…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: For project/government contracts (VS-11.2/VS-46.2), assess over-time recognition: does BuildRight create an asset with no alternative use AND an enforceable right to payment for performance to date? If both → over-time (input/output measure of progress); else point-in-time at delivery/handover
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Project Finance
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4632_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4632_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4632_Task5" name="Select and document the measure of progress (cost-to-cost input method typical…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Select and document the measure of progress (cost-to-cost input method typical for project supply; output/milestone if more faithful); compute % complete, contract revenue, and the onerous-contract check (PAS 37) each period
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Project Finance
Accountable (A): Controller / CFO
Duration: Per period</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4632_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4632_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4632_Task6" name="Reconcile over-time/point-in-time revenue to billings (W165/W1288 progress…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile over-time/point-in-time revenue to billings (W165/W1288 progress billing) and the contract asset/liability (billed-but-unrecognized vs. recognized-but-unbilled); investigate cumulative catch-up at each measurement date
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / AR
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4632_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4632_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4632_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4632_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4632_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-114 (ensure PFRS 15 recognition &amp; cut-off control.) | - CTL-701: documented over-time/point-in-time decision per contract; measure-of-progress reviewed by Controller; contract asset/liability reconciled monthly; onerous-contract provision assessed each period
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
